    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\n\ndef bias(n):\n    counts = Counter(b % n for b in range(256))\n    return [min(counts.values()), max(counts.values())]\n\nfor n in [100, 16, 6]:\n    print(n, bias(n))\n```",
